  {
    "ref": "U00176",
    "text": "- 'cell \"Local View & Remote View Local Viewing: No Network needed, just connect the system to a monitor via HDMI / VGA port and enjoy multiple-cam views on one screen. Remote Viewing: Connect the internet to the DVR . Download the ZOSI Smart app on your smartphone, Or download the AVSS PC client on PC. With remote app, you can view feeds live, receive push notifications and watch any previously recorded footage. You’ll never miss any moment, no matter where you are.\" [ref=e186]':"
