  },
  {
    "ref": "U00182",
    "text": "- cell \"H.265+ Compression Technology H.265+ technology saves about 60% to 90% storage space compared with H.265 standard without any loss of image quality. How does H.265+ dominate? At the same bandwidth, H.265+ deliver sharper and smoother video streaming, without buffering and latency. Significantly reduce video size and save storage space. Relieve network loading pressure, a stable security system is always ensured.\" [ref=e192]:"
