    "text": "- 'cell \"Optional Recording Mode Continuous Record: Your DVR will continuously record regardless of what is Happening. Schedule Record: The schedule is presented as a 24-hour 7 days a week grid and is color coded to represent the event type. Motion Detection Record: Your DVR will only record when motion is detected. It could help to record more time. Recycle Record: This option allows your DVR to overwrite the oldest video files on the hard drive.\" [ref=e200]':"
